# TypeScript filenames

Name every `.ts` and `.tsx` file in kebab-case. Keep exported components and types in PascalCase.

```ts
import { NoteEditor } from "./note-editor";
```

```text
src/components/note-editor.tsx
src/components/settings-dialog.tsx
src/wikilink-inline.tsx
src/dialog.tsx
src/vite-env.d.ts
```

- Use lowercase words separated by hyphens: `media-blocks.tsx`, `graph-view.tsx`.
- A single word stays lowercase: `api.ts`, `main.tsx`.
- The import path matches the filename.
- Rename with `git mv`. On a case-insensitive disk, move through a temporary name (`Dialog.tsx` → `dialog-file.tsx` → `dialog.tsx`).
